### Page 1 of 2

```text
ORDINANCE NO. ________

ENTITLED: "AN ORDINANCE SPECIFYING THE MONTHLY STORMWATER
RUNOFF MANAGEMENT SYSTEM USER FEE IN ACCORDANCE
WITH SECTION 13.32.050 OF THE MUNICIPAL CODE OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING."

BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF
CHEYENNE, WYOMING:

Section 1.  That in accordance with Section 13.32.050 of the municipal code of the city
of Cheyenne, Wyoming, a monthly user fee is hereby established to be imposed on each and
every developed property within the city as provided in this section:

A. Section 13.32.050(B) of the municipal code requires that governing body to establish
by ordinance the fee to be imposed for use of and discharge to the city's stormwater
runoff management system; and

B. In accordance with Section 13.32.050(B) of the municipal code, the fee shall be in the
amount of two thousand four hundred ten-thousandths of a dollar ($0.0024) per square
foot of a property's hard surface.

Section 2.  This ordinance shall only be effective upon the adoption of the implementing
ordinance creating chapter 13.32 of the municipal code of the city of Cheyenne, Wyoming,
establishing the stormwater runoff management system and authorizing the user fee for
necessary funding.

Section 3.  Subject to the limitation imposed by Section 2 of this ordinance, this
ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon approval and publication but no sooner than
January 1, 2026.

FIRST READING:

____________________________________

SECOND READING:

____________________________________

1:49 pm, Nov 19, 2024
```

